  "details": "I just had a bug that if VRChat disconnects and you reconnect while in the loading screen (in this instance it was in the ready to press go screen.) the custom music disappears, and defaults to the original music despite having the custom loading screen enabled. I don't know if this is a unique issue, but something to point out just in case.",
